{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/explore_the_school.png?t=1747702369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take the role of highschool student <i>Kimino</i></strong>\u00a0as she sneaks into her school at night, only to find it transformed into an impossibly vast space that mimics her greatest fears. Carefully navigate this nightmare to learn more about Kimino and help her find happiness through love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/discover_items.png?t=1747702369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Locate mysteriously-placed objects</strong> that may serve Kimino to overcome her fears and find her way safely through unfamiliar surroundings. Investigation is key, however, it is best not to overstay your welcome...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/avoid_horrors.png?t=1747702369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are not alone</strong>\u00a0in these winding halls, and means of self-defense are limited. Careful observation, intent listening, and efficiency in planning your path are necessary to make it from one point of safety to another.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/confront_yourself.png?t=1747702369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Communicate with specters that share your likeness</strong> to<strong>\u00a0</strong>learn more and unravel Kimino's psyche. It is the only way to attain happiness and leave this nightmare.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Good luck.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680110?t=1747702369","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/5185b9910a610d5735d844485c76599f73e5524f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747702369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/d96a930944ab867858da4d131104c6ed25867eca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747702369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/d96a930944ab867858da4d131104c6ed25867eca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747702369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Warning: Certain difficult topics such as self-harm are subtly alluded to."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/explore_the_school.png?t=1747702369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take the role of highschool student <i>Kimino</i></strong>\u00a0as she sneaks into her school at night, only to find it transformed into an impossibly vast space that mimics her greatest fears. Carefully navigate this nightmare to learn more about Kimino and help her find happiness through love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/discover_items.png?t=1747702369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Locate mysteriously-placed objects</strong> that may serve Kimino to overcome her fears and find her way safely through unfamiliar surroundings. Investigation is key, however, it is best not to overs